OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for onshore windfarm scaled
OL,4,Aback by a third
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevelopers have cut the number of
OL,7,Fturbines proposed for a major wind farm
OL,8,Fon moorland after reviewing feedback
OL,9,Ffrom residents and organisations.
OL,11,FRenewable energy firm Cubico
OL,12,FSustainable Investments has reduced the
OL,13,Fnumber of proposed turbines at Scout
OL,14,FMoor II, between Rochdale and
OL,15,FRossendale, from 17 to 12. The site
OL,16,Fwould be next to the existing Scout
OL,17,FMoor wind farm.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
