OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for onshore windfarm scaled
OL,4,Aback by a third
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe revised plans have been submitted
OL,7,Fto Rochdale and Rossendale councils and
OL,8,Fwill now be subject to a further round
OL,9,Fof consultation before councillors
OL,10,Fwhether to approve it.
OL,12,FCampaign group Friends of the Moorland
OL,13,Fsaid it was unlikely the revisions
OL,14,Fwould address all of its concerns.
